Lamba-Merhaba
Maintained by rwennnn.

This project includes a LoRA adapter fine-tuned on cturan/Lamba-750M.
Upstream model: https://huggingface.co/cturan/Lamba-750M
Upstream model license metadata: Apache License 2.0.
The upstream model card identifies Qwen/Qwen3.5-0.8B-Base as its base.
Upstream authors retain their rights to their respective contributions.

Changes: a constant-greeting target was fine-tuned through a separate LoRA
adapter; a local Tkinter chat interface and configurable Windows launcher
were added. The upstream base weights are not merged with the adapter.
Public adapter metadata replaces a machine-specific base path with the
upstream model identifier; the adapter tensor file is unchanged.
